{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20501","headline":"送裴相公赴镇太原 · 张籍","name":"送裴相公赴镇太原","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"盛德雄名远近知，功高先乞守藩维。\n衔恩暂遣分龙节，署勅还同在凤池。\n天子亲临楼上送，朝官齐出道傍辞。\n明年塞北清蕃落，应建生祠请立碑。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张籍","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20501.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20501","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}